{"seq":3,"slug":"trading-markets","title":"交易与市场","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-balancing/economy/trading-markets","wordCount":1603,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"交易与市场\">交易与市场</h1><p>当游戏允许玩家把道具卖给另一个玩家，经济就从「设计师定价的单机系统」变成了「玩家自发定价的市场」。拍卖行里一件稀有装备的价格，不再由策划填表决定，而由成千上万玩家的供需博弈实时形成。这既带来活力（玩家驱动的经济深度），也带来风险（投机、操纵、工作室刷金）。本篇专讲玩家间交易系统的类型、定价机制与风控。市场流通的货币与抽成水槽见 <a href=\"inflation-faucet-sink\">通货膨胀与水龙头水槽</a>，资源的价值折算基础见 <a href=\"../foundations/resources-currency\">资源与货币</a>，市场数据的监控归 <a href=\"../tuning/data-driven-tuning\">数据驱动调优</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>玩家交易系统按「撮合方式」和「开放程度」分类。从点对点的直接交易，到挂单制的拍卖行，再到系统坐市的统一商店，开放度越高、市场越自由，经济活力与风险同步上升。设计的核心权衡是：给玩家多少自由定价权。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[交易系统类型] --&gt; B[点对点直接交易]&#10;  A --&gt; C[拍卖行/挂单市场]&#10;  A --&gt; D[系统坐市统一商店]&#10;  C --&gt; E[供需价格发现]&#10;  E --&gt; F[价格指数/历史]&#10;  C --&gt; G[交易抽成&lt;br/&gt;货币水槽]&#10;  B --&gt; H[风控:工作室/RMT]&#10;  E --&gt; I{价格异常?}&#10;  I --&gt;|操纵/暴涨| J[干预:限价/限量]&#10;  I --&gt;|正常| K[自由流通]\">flowchart TD\n  A[交易系统类型] --&gt; B[点对点直接交易]\n  A --&gt; C[拍卖行/挂单市场]\n  A --&gt; D[系统坐市统一商店]\n  C --&gt; E[供需价格发现]\n  E --&gt; F[价格指数/历史]\n  C --&gt; G[交易抽成&lt;br/&gt;货币水槽]\n  B --&gt; H[风控:工作室/RMT]\n  E --&gt; I{价格异常?}\n  I --&gt;|操纵/暴涨| J[干预:限价/限量]\n  I --&gt;|正常| K[自由流通]</pre><p>下表对比三类交易系统：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>系统</th>\n<th>定价方</th>\n<th>经济活力</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>点对点交易</td>\n<td>双方协商</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>工作室刷金、诈骗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拍卖行挂单</td>\n<td>市场供需</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>投机、囤积、操纵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>系统统一商店</td>\n<td>设计师</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>缺活力、套利</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"自由市场与价格发现\">自由市场与价格发现</h2><p>拍卖行的魅力在于「价格发现」——价格由供需自发形成，反映物品的真实稀缺度。一件掉率低、需求高的装备会自然涨价，掉率高的会跌价，无需设计师干预。这套机制让经济有了「真实感」和深度，老玩家可以靠交易致富，形成独立于战斗的玩法层。</p>\n<p>价格发现服从基本的供需规律：均衡价格出现在供给量等于需求量之处。设需求量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_d = a - b \\cdot p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>（价高需求降）、供给量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_s = c + d \\cdot p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>（价高供给增），均衡价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8831em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_d = Q_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^* = \\frac{a - c}{b + d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9331em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>设计师虽不直接定价，却能通过调节掉率（影响供给的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c, d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>）和需求侧设计（影响 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a, b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>）间接引导价格。比如想让某材料降价，就提高它的掉落或开放新产出渠道，曲线右移、均衡价下降。这种「用产出旋钮调市场」的手法，与 <a href=\"inflation-faucet-sink\">通货膨胀与水龙头水槽</a> 的水龙头调节是同一套杠杆。</p>\n<h2 id=\"投机-囤积与操纵\">投机、囤积与操纵</h2><p>自由市场的阴暗面是投机与操纵。玩家会囤积稀缺资源等涨价，大户会联手「扫货拉盘」制造人为短缺再高价抛售。这些行为本身是市场的自然产物，但过度时会扭曲价格、伤害普通玩家。</p>\n<p>风控手段分几类。透明化：公示历史成交价与挂单深度，让玩家看清真实行情，压缩信息差套利空间。摩擦：交易抽成（5%–15%）和挂单手续费提高高频投机成本，同时充当货币水槽。限制：对关键道具设单日交易量上限、设置价格上下限带（防止恶意挂天价或砸盘）。绑定：把最影响平衡的物品设为「绑定不可交易」，从根上隔离市场风险。下表对比这些手段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>价格/成交历史公示</td>\n<td>压缩信息差</td>\n<td>暴露行情、便于跟风</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交易抽成</td>\n<td>抑制高频投机 + 回收货币</td>\n<td>略增交易摩擦</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交易量/价格带限制</td>\n<td>防操纵</td>\n<td>限制自由度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物品绑定</td>\n<td>隔离平衡风险</td>\n<td>削弱市场深度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"工作室-rmt-与外部市场\">工作室、RMT 与外部市场</h2><p>只要游戏内资产能换钱，就会出现「金币工作室」用脚本批量刷金，再通过 RMT（real-money trading，现实货币交易）卖给玩家。这是几乎所有有交易系统的游戏都面对的顽疾——它在游戏外形成黑市，把设计师辛苦平衡的经济抽走价值，还助长外挂、盗号。</p>\n<p>对抗 RMT 没有银弹，靠组合拳：检测异常交易模式（同一账号高频大额、固定路径转移），用图分析识别工作室账号网络（资金从多个小号汇向少数提现号）；提高刷金成本（反外挂、产出依赖人工而非可脚本化操作）；以及设计层面减少「纯刷金」的价值（让核心成长品绑定、不可交易）。这些检测高度依赖对局与交易数据的实时回流分析，方法见 <a href=\"../tuning/data-driven-tuning\">数据驱动调优</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"市场监控与干预\">市场监控与干预</h2><p>一个有玩家市场的游戏，必须有一套市场监控仪表盘，像央行盯宏观经济一样盯游戏经济。核心监控项：关键商品价格指数及其波动率、市场总成交额、挂单/成交比（流动性）、价格异常告警。当某物价格在短时间暴涨暴跌，系统应触发告警，让运营判断是正常供需还是操纵。</p>\n<p>干预要克制。市场最忌「朝令夕改」——频繁的限价、回收、规则变动会摧毁玩家对经济的信任，导致囤积观望甚至抛售崩盘。健康的做法是把绝大多数事交给市场自己调节，只在出现操纵、漏洞刷取、严重通胀传染时才动手，且干预前先用 <a href=\"../tuning/simulation-modeling\">数值仿真与建模</a> 推演后果。市场的稳定，归根结底来自整个经济的产出—消耗平衡是否健康，单靠市场端的手术治标不治本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>玩家交易把经济从「设计师定价」变为「市场定价」，按撮合方式分点对点、拍卖行、系统商店，自由度越高活力与风险同升。</li>\n<li>拍卖行的价值是「价格发现」，均衡价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^*=\\frac{a-c}{b+d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8831em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2057em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8023em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 由供需决定；设计师通过调掉率与需求间接引导价格。</li>\n<li>投机、囤积、操纵是自由市场的自然阴暗面，用公示透明、交易抽成、量价限制、物品绑定组合风控。</li>\n<li>工作室与 RMT 是顽疾，靠异常交易检测、图分析识别账号网络、提高刷金成本、核心品绑定组合对抗。</li>\n<li>必须像盯宏观经济一样监控市场（价格指数、成交额、流动性、异常告警），但干预要克制，治本仍在产出—消耗平衡。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"交易与市场","id":"交易与市场"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"自由市场与价格发现","id":"自由市场与价格发现"},{"level":2,"text":"投机、囤积与操纵","id":"投机-囤积与操纵"},{"level":2,"text":"工作室、RMT 与外部市场","id":"工作室-rmt-与外部市场"},{"level":2,"text":"市场监控与干预","id":"市场监控与干预"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"通货膨胀与水龙头水槽","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-balancing/economy/inflation-faucet-sink"},"next":{"title":"数值仿真与建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-balancing/tuning/simulation-modeling"}}